# __DISPLAY_NAME__ workspace

uv workspace containing the `__PROJECT_NAME__` PySide6 Widgets application.

## Develop

```powershell
uv sync
uv run --package __PROJECT_NAME__ python apps/__PROJECT_NAME__/scripts/compile_ui.py
uv run --package __PROJECT_NAME__ pytest apps/__PROJECT_NAME__/tests
uv run --package __PROJECT_NAME__ __PROJECT_NAME__
```

## Build

```powershell
uv build --package __PROJECT_NAME__
uv run --package __PROJECT_NAME__ python apps/__PROJECT_NAME__/scripts/package_app.py --profile minimal
```

The packaging wrapper audits the runtime bundle and performs a hidden packaged-app smoke test. Use `--profile full` only when the application intentionally needs Qt modules or plugins excluded by the Widgets-only minimal profile.
